---
import ProseLayout from '../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<ProseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  metaTitle="Privacy policy"
  description="What this site stores, what it does not collect, and your rights under GDPR and CCPA. No accounts, no tracking, no third-party scripts."
  path="/privacy"
  lastUpdated="2026-08-20"
  keywords={['privacy policy', 'gdpr', 'ccpa']}
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what {SITE.name} collects, what it does not, and what rights you have. The short
    version: the site has no accounts, no analytics and no advertising, and nothing you type into a calculator
    is transmitted anywhere.
  </p>

  <p class="rounded-md border border-caution/40 bg-caution-surface p-3 text-xs text-caution">
    <strong>Owner placeholder.</strong> Before launch the operator must insert their legal entity name,
    registered address and jurisdiction below, and replace the contact address. The checklist in DEPLOY.md
    lists every placeholder on the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>

  <p>
    The data controller for this site is <strong>[LEGAL ENTITY NAME]</strong>, of
    <strong>[REGISTERED ADDRESS]</strong>, <strong>[JURISDICTION]</strong>. You can reach us at
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What the calculators do with your input</h2>

  <p>
    Nothing leaves your device. Every calculation runs in your browser using JavaScript served from
    this domain. Your height, weight, age, measurements and results are never transmitted to this
    site or anyone else, because the site is a set of static files with no server-side processing
    and no database to store anything in.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you share a results link containing values in the address bar, those values travel in that
    URL — so treat a shared link the same way you would treat sending the numbers themselves.
  </p>

  <h2>What is stored on your device</h2>

  <p>
    Two preferences are saved in your browser's local storage so the site remembers them between
    visits:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>theme</strong> — whether you chose the light or dark appearance.</li>
    <li><strong>units</strong> — whether you chose metric or imperial.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Local storage is not a cookie and is not transmitted with requests. These values stay on your
    device, are readable only by this site, and are removed when you clear your browser data. No
    identifier, profile or fingerprint is stored.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>

  <p>
    This site sets no cookies. See the <a href="/cookies/">cookie policy</a> for detail, including what
    would change if advertising were introduced later.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics and tracking</h2>

  <p>
    There are none. No analytics package, no tag manager, no pixels, no session recording, no
    fingerprinting, and no third-party scripts of any kind. Fonts are self-hosted, so your browser
    makes no request to any other domain while using this site.
  </p>

  <h2>Server logs</h2>

  <p>
    The site is served by a hosting provider that, like all web hosts, processes connection
    information such as IP address, user agent and requested URL in order to deliver pages and
    protect against abuse. This is handled by the host under its own privacy terms and is not used
    by us to build profiles or track individuals across sessions.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>

  <p>
    Under the UK and EU General Data Protection Regulation you have rights of access, rectification,
    erasure, restriction, portability and objection, and the right to complain to your supervisory
    authority. Under the California Consumer Privacy Act you have rights to know, delete, correct
    and opt out of sale or sharing.
  </p>

  <p>
    In practice there is very little to exercise these against: we hold no account, no profile and
    no identifiable record of you. We do not sell or share personal information, and we never have.
    Preferences stored on your device are under your control and can be removed by clearing your
    browser data. To make a request or ask what is held, contact
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>

  <p>
    This site is not directed at children, and the calculators refuse to produce calorie or
    body-composition results for anyone under 18. We do not knowingly collect information from
    children, and there is no mechanism by which we could.
  </p>

  <h2>International transfers</h2>

  <p>
    Static files are distributed through a content delivery network with servers worldwide, so pages
    may be served from a location near you. No personal data is transferred, because none is
    collected.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

  <p>
    If advertising or analytics are introduced in future, this policy will be updated before they go
    live, the consent mechanism described in the <a href="/cookies/">cookie policy</a> will be activated,
    and the change will be reflected in the date below.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
